        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Rolling updates, blue-green deployments, and canary releases give a Kubernetes platform team three distinct ways to balance delivery speed, rollback confidence, and production risk.",
          "bullet": false
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Use this title slide to frame the decision guide. The following pages will compare rolling, blue-green, and canary strategies by operational trade-offs rather than treating one approach as universally best."
}

